# Line endings are pinned in the repository, not left to each clone's
# core.autocrlf. Every text file is LF in the index AND in the working tree on
# every OS: tests compare bytes and hashes, the gettext catalogue is checked
# byte-for-byte against its compiled .mo, and scripts carry shebangs. A
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check out CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.mo binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
